OL,3,APrince Harry and six others ordered to
OL,4,Apay initial #9.5m to Daily Mail
OL,5,Apublisher
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince Harry and a group of six other
OL,8,Fhigh-profile figures have been ordered
OL,9,Fto make an initial payment of #9.54m to
OL,10,Fthe Daily Mail's publisher after they
OL,11,Flost their High Court privacy case.
OL,13,FThe seven claimants, also including Sir
OL,14,FElton John and Liz Hurley, must pay the
OL,15,Finitial figure by 28 August - and could
OL,16,Fpotentially pay up to #25m more after
OL,17,Fthat in a victory for Associated
OL,18,FNewspapers Limited (ANL).
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
