OL,3,APrince Harry and six others ordered to
OL,4,Apay initial #9.5m to Daily Mail
OL,5,Apublisher
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe group had sued ANL over allegations
OL,8,Fof unlawful information-gathering,
OL,9,Fwhich the publisher had strenuously
OL,10,Fdenied.
OL,12,FOn 7 July, Judge Mr Justice Nicklin
OL,13,Fdismissed the claims and said the
OL,14,Fpublic figures had failed to prove the
OL,15,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
