OL,3,ARosenberg: Shortage of petrol but not
OL,4,Apatriotism as Russians feel growing
OL,5,Aimpact of war
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt a petrol station in the south-east
OL,8,Fof Moscow, Svyatoslav has been queuing
OL,9,Fin his car for two hours.
OL,11,FThe sign board up ahead has just been
OL,12,Fchanged to show there's no fuel.
OL,14,F"They say there will be petrol here,"
OL,15,FSvyatoslav tells me optimistically.
OL,16,F"They just don't know when. Maybe
OL,17,Ftoday, maybe tomorrow."
OL,19,FI ask him why he doesn't drive off and
OL,20,Flook for another place to fill up.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
