OL,3,AEight killed in plane crash at remote
OL,4,AAlaskan military site, air force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plane crash at a remote US Air Force
OL,7,Fsite in Alaska has killed all eight
OL,8,Fpeople on board, the US military has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe civilian-contracted aircraft
OL,12,Fcrashed shortly after midday local time
OL,13,F(20:00 GMT) on Thursday near Cape
OL,14,FNewenham, which hosts the airport of a
OL,15,Flong-range radar site.
OL,17,FIt is unclear who the passengers were
OL,18,For why they were there, but the US Air
OL,19,FForce Alaskan Command chief said they
OL,20,Fhad been "dedicated professionals
OL,21,Fcarrying out a vital mission in a
OL,22,Fdemanding environment".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
