OL,3,AEight killed in plane crash at remote
OL,4,AAlaskan military site, air force says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is a devastating loss for our
OL,7,Fmilitary family and the communities we
OL,8,Fserve," Lt Gen Robert Davis added.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
